  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tbsp of vegetable oil in a large hot-pot vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped onion and minced garlic and saute until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add chopped lemongrass and saute for 1 minute.",
    "Add 2 cups of water and bring to a boil.",
    "Add semolina pasta, fish sauce, soy sauce, and sugar. Stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes or until the semolina pasta is cooked.",
